    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d827">

                <pb facs="1109" n="1003" sameAs="frus:frus1933-39/pg1003"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">300.115(39) City of Flint/62: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-10-29T14:00:00+03:00">October 29, 1939—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 29—10:22 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>830. The press this morning publishes the following Tass despatch: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The steamship <hi rendition="#italic">City of Flint</hi> has left
                            Murmansk.</p>
                        <p>Murmansk October 28 Tass. On October 28 in the evening the steamship <hi
                                rendition="#italic">City of Flint</hi> after the machinery had been
                            repaired, left the port of Murmansk.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
